## Description

The Student Grade Tracker is a Java-based console application designed to manage and analyze student academic performance. This project allows users to input student names and grades, store the data using ArrayList, and generate a detailed performance report.

The application calculates important statistics such as:

* Average score
* Highest score
* Lowest score

It is developed using Object-Oriented Programming (OOP) concepts in Java, making the code structured, reusable, and easy to understand. The project provides a simple and interactive console interface for users to manage student records efficiently.

This project is suitable for beginners learning Java, collections, loops, conditional statements, and basic data management.
